# Force git to treat known text formats as text even when a stray
# control byte (e.g. an accidental '\x00' literal in a source file)
# trips its automatic binary heuristic. Without this, diffs of an
# affected file show "Bin 110095 bytes" and code review stalls.
*.dart text
*.rs text
*.toml text
*.yaml text
*.yml text
*.json text
*.md text
*.sh text eol=lf
*.sql text
Dockerfile text
.gitignore text
